<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wesfarmers 9 month net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wesfarmers 9 month net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended March 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		150.84 vs 104.05</p>
<p>    Net profit			 97.00 vs 64.45</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		   1.82 vs 1.74</p>
<p>NOTE: Wesfarmers Ltd is a diversified agricultural and chemical group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
